    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i just got the most insane headache out of nowhere. like it hit me instantly and it feels way worse than my usual migraines. i’ve had bad migraines for years so i'm hoping it's just a really bad one, but i'm kinda freaked out. is it normal for them to hit this fast and hard?",
