      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, a thunderclap migraine? I've never heard of that. I'm just worried because it really feels different from my normal ones... like, it's almost like a literal strike to the head. Are you sure it's just a migraine thing? You said I should take aspirin and ibuprofen together, is that safe to do right now?",
